<title>BAHRAIN: Bank of Bahrain, Kuwait Q1 net edges up.</title>
<headline>Bank of Bahrain, Kuwait Q1 net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit		  2.70   vs    2.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	    2.83   vs    2.84</p>
<p> Net interest income     3.76   vs    3.71</p>
<p> Other income		1.66   vs    1.62</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity   79.29   vs   77.50</p>
<p> Total assets	    839.50   vs  742.69</p>
<p>Full name: Bank of Bahrain and Kuwait.</p>
<p>Note: The Bahrain-based bank is owned equally by financial institutions and investors in Kuwait and Bahrain.</p>
<p>-- Manama newsroom - 973-536187</p>
